medication.add_confirm_prompt:
Before I save {name}, I’d like to confirm a few details:
  • Dose: {dosage}
  • Timing: {schedule}
  • Notes: {instructions}

If dose or timing is still unclear, you can update them now for more accurate reminders — or save as-is and fix later. Reply "yes" to save, or send a corrected message (e.g. "Aspirin 100mg after breakfast").

medication.confirm_dose_ambiguous:
I see more than one dose that could match. Which one did you take?
{options}
You can reply with the medication name and time, or say "all" if you took all listed doses.

medication.confirm_dose_note_ambiguous:
I found more than one recent taken dose. Which dose should I attach this note to?
{options}
Please reply with the medication name and time.
